        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite</strong> Deeper Crossing</p><hr /><p>The mask stops being something you put on. Your <strong>Borrowed Nature</strong> Aspect &mdash; the 6th-level version, not the 12th &mdash; is <strong>always active</strong>: no action, no Reiatsu Point, no duration, and <strong>no Will penalty</strong>.</p><p>Donning the Other Face still upgrades you to the <strong>Deeper Crossing</strong> numbers for 1 minute, twice per encounter.</p><hr /><p><em>Canon: this is the exact difference between a Visored who has to summon the mask and one who no longer needs to.</em></p>"
